The '''Golden Dragon''' is an [[NPC]] found in the [[Dragon's Lair (Crystal Hollows)|Dragon's Lair]] in the [[Crystal Hollows]]. They sell the {{Item|Golden Dragon Egg}} that hatches into the {{Item|Golden Dragon Pet}}.

== Overview ==
*{{Item|Golden Dragon Egg}} can be purchased for:
::{{C|500m}};
::{{Item|Enchanted Gold Block|amount=50}};
::{{Item|Perfect Amethyst Gemstone|amount=1}};
::{{Item|Perfect Jade Gemstone|amount=1}};
::{{Item|Perfect Sapphire Gemstone|amount=1}};
::{{Item|Perfect Amber Gemstone|amount=1}};
::{{Item|Perfect Topaz Gemstone|amount=1}}.
* Purchasing one grants the [[Achievements#The Golden Dragon's Egg|The Golden Dragon's Egg]] achievement to the player.
* There's no limit on the amount of eggs per lobby.

